b.org/t/p/w780/pnTz2xd44bE64Fe2xeysl5WPDXI.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2025-10-22\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"On-the-go snacking olives; a line of stylish labor gowns and maternity wear; a first-aid kit for kids; healing teas made from flowers; guest shark Allison Ellsworth.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gwByLkLeO85ryBRvBIyT8pvOh66.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2025-11-05\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"A helmet designed for surfing; snackable pasta chips; 3D-printed string instruments; a signature ramen dish one can make from home.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mg830DifhlGJ16GIyH5ATbKZP7l.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2025-11-12\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Cash or Coal?: The Sharks Get Into the Holiday Spirit with Festive Pitches & Products\",\"overview\":\"Entrepreneurs present seasonal offerings in hopes of landing an investment deal with the Sharks.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2WDKLJN0vLOM9kdpkwflhnrZ5f3.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-12-10\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Urine for a Surprise: Would NFL Legend Michael Strahan Use This Personal Product in Public?\",\"overview\":\"A portable relief bottle; precision golf tees; a trusted nosebleed solution; digital windows that improve one's health; Michael Strahan returns as guest shark.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kYf1Gee8GP1krm9JL3yeKtfg0vt.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2026-01-07\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"5 Sharks and a Baby: Can This New Invention Provide Sleep for Newborns and Their Parents?\",\"overview\":\"A baby-soothing device; date-sweetened chocolate; a DIY crafting studio; a poolside party service.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/50YJNToPfhrhqXy4TVGYRLwzOkb.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2026-01-14\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Dating in the Wild: Will the Sharks Say Yes to a Unique Dating App? Alexis Ohanian Returns\",\"overview\":\"An e-compass for finding friends, a no-swipe dating app, customizable screen protectors, and an app for hosting soccer pick-up games. Alexis Ohanian returns as guest shark.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9fTI10MIuJAhbS2FZObqd2mIuFp.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2026-01-21\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Snooze You Lose: Do the Sharks Wake Up to this Ingenious New Dorm Bed? Chip & Joanna Gaines Return to the Tank\",\"overview\":\"A dorm bed extender for added comfort, a marriage proposal planning service, a backyard game mashup, and a rechargeable cordless box cutter. Chip & Joanna Gaines return as guest sharks.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fkPTtocbzrfRyktxBpJh4jlE2Wn.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2026-01-28\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"New Guest Shark: Fawn Weaver, Founder of One of the Fastest Growing Premium Whiskeys Joins the Tank!\",\"overview\":\"Cranberry wellness shots; a cozy chair cover; shoelaces that stayed tied; kitty litter made from olive pits; Fawn Weaver guest judges.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s7snZ0He0nFeLFa3Ub4KXgO4eAg.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2026-03-04\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Pop or Fizzle? Will Guest Shark, Beverage Billionaire Allison Ellsworth Take a Chance on a Soda Newbie?\",\"overview\":\"A low-sugar, aloe vera-based soda, a grocery store without packaging, reclaimed golf balls, and tangle-free hair ties. Allison Ellsworth returns as a guest shark.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/onRB2uLguP8d8TOWHo14HttCcMN.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2026-03-11\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Girl Power: Will Guest Shark, Beverage Mogul Fawn Weaver, Buy Into a Beer Made for Women?\",\"overview\":\"Beer without the bloat, a snoring-prevention straw, mushroom-based earplugs, and a line of expressive press-on nails. Fawn Weaver returns as a guest shark.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uW36qIRXwZPyLqXsZdmWvvc7bNF.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2026-03-18\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Good Hang!: Mark Cuban's Back with an Exciting Update. Plus, Will a Picture-Hanging Invention Hook a Shark?\",\"overview\":\"Interactive tutoring centers, a clever picture-hanging tool, a camping bed for cars, and oversized, collapsible building blocks. Mark Cuban gives a business update.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ukE1gjGK7V3PkgRyx6uPv6keGZo.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2026-03-25\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Shark Attack: The Sharks Battle Over a Game-Changer Product for Athletes. Who Wins?\",\"overview\":\"An app to curb phone distractions, a revolutionary baseball bat grip, all-fruit tropical ice pops, and clean glam products for the next generation.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ulieIRodAI93KaLXL56qRjsfiyk.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2026-04-08\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Million Dollar Offer: See Which Shark Makes a Million Dollar Offer for a Never-Before-Seen Idea!\",\"overview\":\"Ambitious entrepreneurs wow the Sharks with game-changing ideas, including an e-compass for finding friends, a no-swipe dating app, customizable screen protectors, and an app for hosting soccer pick-up games.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7hri6Odg7qrcjcEdDeuv4iUEip.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2026-04-15\",\"runtime\":44},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Season Finale: Which Shark Will Get a Slice of a Unique Family Based Pizza Business? Plus an Update on Pete Davidson's Sock Company.\",\"overview\":\"A beginner-friendly social investing platform, tasty low-calorie sweets, a shipping service for over-packers, and a frozen pizza brand that champions the deaf community.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xMtPEFtAQbeqQhIvxUp0mZBME9O.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2026-04-22\",\"runtime\":44}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2009-08-09\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}